{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2021-09-09 10:00:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN GRANTS $400,000 TO FOOD BANKS TO COMBAT FOOD INSECURITY', 'text': 'ATLANTA, SEPT. 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) TODAY ANNOUNCED $400,000 IN GRANTS TO 31 FOOD BANKS LOCATED ACROSS THE STATES SERVED BY THE COMPANY.'}